95:Fisher's exact and Mann-Whitney U tests were conducted with the scipy.stats python module (v1.13.1). The EVDs in Figure 5 and Supplementary Fig. 4 were fitted using scipy.stats.genextreme (v1.13.1). Spearman correlations (Figs. 5E-F) were calculated with scipy.stats,spearmanr (v1.13.1). Benjamini-Yekutieli was carried out with the scikit-learn implementation (v1.5.1).
